WEBVTT

00:01.000 --> 00:03.270
His room was messy.

00:03.390 --> 00:06.930
That tells us. But how messy was it?

00:07.050 --> 00:12.700
A metaphor says one thing is another thing, without like or as.

00:12.820 --> 00:15.350
His room was a junkyard.

00:15.470 --> 00:18.480
Wow. Now we can see the mess!

00:18.600 --> 00:23.630
Here is one more. After the race, my legs were jelly.

00:23.750 --> 00:30.227
So look for one thing called something it isn't, and try one in your own writing!
